# Application Monitoring

- Use **Laravel Telescope** for application monitoring, debugging, queries, requests, jobs, and exceptions.
- Do not add a second Laravel debug/monitoring UI (Debugbar as the primary debugger, Horizon-only exception browsing, ad-hoc request log dashboards) when Telescope already covers the need.
- Keep Telescope gated to local/non-production environments unless the project already documents a locked-down production install.
